Package: uberphoto
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Mirgen <mirgen@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, perl
Recommends: libxkbcommon0, libx11-6, libwayland-client0, libvulkan1
Homepage: https://github.com/Ogalesha/UberPhoto
Description: Local-first photo manager with non-destructive editing
 UberPhoto browses real folders, edits EXIF/IPTC/XMP metadata through the
 bundled ExifTool, places GPS coordinates on OpenStreetMap, applies
 non-destructive color recipes and exports web-ready images with verified
 metadata.
 .
 Photographs never leave the local disk: no server, no upload.
